OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill continue cloudy and dry but
OL,7,Fpatchy rain will spread to Orkney
OL,8,Ftowards midnight and Shetland later.
OL,9,FRain becomes widespread over Orkney
OL,10,Ftowards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain becoming locally heavy from mid-
OL,14,Fmorning. The rain will clear Orkney
OL,15,Ftowards the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain
OL,18,Fclears Shetland early Sunday. This
OL,19,Fwill be followed by clear or bright
OL,20,Fspells interspersed with the
OL,21,Foccasional shower Monday and Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
